WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
A G1 robot stands at the foot of a padded incline in a laboratory. Its overhead safety tether and an operator holding the controller are visible in the portrait frame.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.800
The robot takes steps onto the padded incline and is upright near the end. The selected silent excerpt ends before the later trial outcome.
